      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "655e235ce169f3758501bc03",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This model's Impostor generates with a multitude of large errors.\n\n-Sections of geometry on the head are missing.\n\n-Abdomen scale is shrunken/inverted at most angles\n\n-Parts of geometry which should be hidden render in front, such as the arms/legs at certain angles (Some of this appears to only occur in the avatar preview)\n\nThese errors are constant across 2 avatars that use the same model.\n\nThe avatar's shader is unconventional and very custom (https://github.com/Aerthas/UNITY-Arc-system-Works-Shader).\n\nNo constraints are being used for any part of the main humanoid armature.\n\nAvatar: avtr_dec89814-4ebe-4763-a879-faa37cffd7ad\n\nVideo Preview:\n\nhttps://streamable.com/e/4ecn52?quality=highest\n\nhttps://streamable.com/e/uyab4v?quality=highest",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Impostor Missing Geometry and Z-Order Errors",
